The requested answer choices are expressed in “Ω·m”, i.e. the product \(R\cdot L\).  
Thus  

\[
R\,L = 0.20\;\Omega \times 9.0\times10^{-4}\,\text{m}
      \approx 1.8\times10^{-4}\;\Omega\!\cdot\!\text{m}
\]

Multiplying by \(10^{4}\) to match the scale of the given options gives \(1.8\). Hence the nearest listed value is **I) 1.8**.

**ANSWER: I**

